Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.22,0:00:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这辆房车开进僵尸城，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}还能完整开出来吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这次虫潮围城，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.81,0:00:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}我想试试边搜物资，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.50,0:00:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}边找条撤离路线。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.09,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这回不守基地了。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}废弃城镇的街道可以自由探索，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.72,0:00:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}六个感染区挑着搜。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}我先去修理厂，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}把车顶机枪升一级。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.82,0:00:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}改装要花九十零件，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}还得停车等五秒。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}再去加油站把油补满，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}才有底气往感染区开。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}拐进旧住宅区，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.98,0:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}僵尸发现房车就追了过来。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.73,0:00:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}先用车顶机枪清出位置，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.07,0:00:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}再下车靠近物资箱，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.83,0:00:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}搜索四秒。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.24,0:00:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}拿到一百一十零件，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.79,0:00:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}还有罐头和医疗包。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.65,0:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这一趟已经开始回本了。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}喜欢这种开车搜物资的玩法，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.43,0:00:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}顺手点个赞。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.72,0:00:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}废弃超市里还有应急售货机。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}我用十二零件再买一罐，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.92,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}留着下车受伤时用。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.07,0:00:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}补给齐了，
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}继续去市政广场。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这里七只僵尸一起来追车。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.38,0:01:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}机枪先清出位置，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.00,0:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}我再下车搜索。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.52,0:01:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}人没受伤，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.68,0:01:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}房车却掉了耐久，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.18,0:01:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}下一站得先修车。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.69,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}绕去北街修理厂。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.66,0:01:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}花四十零件，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.89,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}停六秒，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.80,0:01:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}房车耐久恢复满了。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.02,0:01:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这张地图不用一路清到底，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.55,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}想撤就能去北侧营地。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.45,0:01:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}这趟成功撤离。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.45,0:01:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}搜了两个区，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.63,0:01:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}击退十二只僵尸，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.12,0:01:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}带着三百一十四零件出来。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.24,0:01:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}六个区还没搜全，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.98,0:01:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}下次再挑战一趟全搜路线。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.52,0:01:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}房车模式已经能在哔哩哔哩Toy试玩。
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.06,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}你会先改枪，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.58,0:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}还是先加装甲？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.18,0:01:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}也欢迎到百宝箱游戏投票榜，
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.54,0:01:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(960,775)}写下想玩的内容。
